      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "QA witnesses — the published projection of every verdict",
      "prov:value": "That tree is the run's\nWORKING COPY; the durable record is the commit-keyed entry the CI job\n`qa-publish` writes to `qa-reports` through `qa-store.ts` (arc `3fva`).",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean 3fva"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/qa-witness.md#provenance-2",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "QA witnesses — the published projection of every verdict",
      "prov:value": "Until\nbean `5hox` removes them, the files are also still committed on `main` — a\ncopy on its way out, not the record, so do not regenerate a witness to\n\"commit the result\".",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean 5hox"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/qa-witness.md#provenance-3",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "QA witnesses — the published projection of every verdict",
      "prov:value": "It sat in `docs/` until 2026-09-19 only because that is where\nJekyll could reach it, which is a fact about the build and not about the\nartefact.",
