      "cat-harness:section": "Where things are",
      "prov:value": "Auditor in `skills/kg-qa.manifest.json` |\n| judgements behind a verdict | `test/attestations/<family>/<mirrored subject path>.attestations.json` (`qa-attestations/v1`, the `attestations` graph): every agent, human and baseline-pair judgement, kept on `main` because regeneration cannot reproduce it (owner ruling D2 (a)).",
